{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04932","headline":"奉和九月九日登慈恩寺浮屠应制 · 岑羲","name":"奉和九月九日登慈恩寺浮屠应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宝台耸天外，玉辇步云端。\n日丽重阳景，风摇季月寒。\n梵堂遥集鴈，帝乐近翔鸾。\n愿献延龄酒，长承湛露欢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04932.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04932","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}